      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Terrific race with half a dozen win chances. ROSSANADO (4) was a winner fresh then runner-up last two. Freshened for this and expected to go close again. VIERI (7) ran on hard to score over a mile here last time and also has been freshened. This tougher but nice weight drop. STRUCK GOLD (1) was runner-up in a similar race fresh and strips fitter. Can go on with it. BRUNO BRUNO (5) missed the frame for the first time this course and distance last time when fourth in the same race as STRUCK GOLD. Was unbeaten from three tries course and distance prior to that. HENNESSY LAD (6) is overdue and looks likely to feature again.",
